/* Centered full-screen overlay shown while a remix source is being
   prepared (audio download + lyric recovery). Sits above the maximized
   player and sheets so the user always sees what's happening.
   NO backdrop-filter here — blurring the whole page while the main
   thread is busy downloading/parsing froze the spinner on iOS. Entry
   uses keyframe animations (they start on display change, no JS frame
   needed) and the spinner is promoted to its own compositor layer so
   it keeps turning even when JS is blocked. */
.remixLoadingOverlay{
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 100000;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 24px;
  background: rgba(4, 6, 12, 0.78);
  animation: remixOverlayIn 160ms ease-out;
}
