/* ---- Hidden compatibility nodes ------------------------------------- */
/* Old play/pause/stop buttons stay in the DOM so existing JS can still
 * toggle their disabled state, but they are visually removed. The new
 * `.playerToggleBtn` does the visible work and clicks the legacy
 * buttons internally. */
