/* Profile skeleton states — used while the user's Hub posts are still
 * loading for the first time. Mirrors the real layout (hero card,
 * top-week carousel cards, releases list rows) so the swap-in feels
 * continuous instead of jumping. Reuses the hubSkelShimmer keyframe
 * already declared next to the Hub skeleton. */
